        "slc_b3d370ccef230321feb845f5ac476e5d1bb9b4f32f113b2306d995be42ce229c"
      ],
      "text": "The product is a Visual Studio extension whose commands appear under the Extensions menu (moved there in v1.9.0; earlier versions placed them under Tools)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0c52b5e9fa3c5908562badbbc1a9ff895266ea12d234b218523ca3003e54c890",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0",
          "git_sha": "2641425b9a93795eafaeb06bc8298da859cb5df0",
          "line_end": 6,
          "line_start": 6,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "emilianomusso/entwinellm",
          "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoMusso/EntwineLLM/blob/05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0/README.md#L6-L6"
        },
        {
          "commit": "05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0",
          "git_sha": "2641425b9a93795eafaeb06bc8298da859cb5df0",
          "line_end": 10,
          "line_start": 10,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "emilianomusso/entwinellm",
          "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoMusso/EntwineLLM/blob/05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0/README.md#L10-L10"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_096428545836db146428e1c0bc95ae027cd0192cac3d413dc08eed0a04918ea8",
        "slc_575381b98dec7bac3c840422dad77add955c145c86aeccadad372386c3f31d6f"
      ],
      "text": "The extension requires a local or Docker-hosted open LLM implementation such as Ollama or LMStudio, running and exposing an API endpoint reachable from Visual Studio."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_94d78c25a498fcad49d89b45d05e174f2926ca8cbac3eeeb0ede5c775f3fdfac",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0",
          "git_sha": "2641425b9a93795eafaeb06bc8298da859cb5df0",
          "line_end": 19,
          "line_start": 19,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "emilianomusso/entwinellm",
          "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoMusso/EntwineLLM/blob/05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0/README.md#L19-L19"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_fba17130be6fb8a389d9ddcee6685b05e9dfeda18c6ce6a87c12e575588b10a3"
      ],
      "text": "Configuration options in the Visual Studio Options menu let users set the LLM base URL, choose a model per command, set HTTP request timeouts, and pick the answer language."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fee01852baee4e1725f417e41810c0a20f4a1e2975d17c7605f0b18bc375d17a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0",
          "git_sha": "2641425b9a93795eafaeb06bc8298da859cb5df0",
          "line_end": 41,
          "line_start": 37,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "emilianomusso/entwinellm",
          "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoMusso/EntwineLLM/blob/05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0/README.md#L37-L41"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1caed8b9147d133fc6776bb563ba040d9a9481e4d33038077cf45927c5cee455"
      ],
      "text": "Available commands include Refactor code, Generate unit tests, Follow-up, and Document code, which query the configured LLM and show results in a window."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6f3de731e7a42cf1e2d117a1297a4837fb3c6feaf2a24000a9af19a720d5fffd",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0",
          "git_sha": "2641425b9a93795eafaeb06bc8298da859cb5df0",
          "line_end": 45,
          "line_start": 45,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "emilianomusso/entwinellm",
          "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoMusso/EntwineLLM/blob/05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0/README.md#L45-L45"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_42080df5dd1e595a860265846184dd58cd773372379a7b15c782a44f5a735658"
      ],
      "text": "Generated output can overwrite the selected code via an Apply button or be saved to a dynamically named file in the current project folder via a Save button."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_95412ace5f12b83315def870104145fffb95a11cfb725736c30c60f80fa8d8e8",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0",
          "git_sha": "2641425b9a93795eafaeb06bc8298da859cb5df0",
          "line_end": 50,
          "line_start": 50,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "emilianomusso/entwinellm",
          "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoMusso/EntwineLLM/blob/05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0/README.md#L50-L50"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_945cd60c7a0b1d6d5c7b9fd70606dce3fdb6d941e48b0cc482a744d38ab3dffe"
      ],
      "text": "Prompts target multiple languages (C#, Python, Java), reject non-coding requests, and enforce Clean Code principles with raw, comment-free output following Allman-style braces."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a42471615f9e043609df3b25db5a2ac4366448d94b35bb0353c0cced01632b30",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0",
          "git_sha": "2641425b9a93795eafaeb06bc8298da859cb5df0",
          "line_end": 53,
          "line_start": 53,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "emilianomusso/entwinellm",
          "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoMusso/EntwineLLM/blob/05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0/README.md#L53-L53"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a11dc1e5372af060744a5fe2fe2dce24233afbf847412aeaef95ec1ac6c4b5e9"
      ],
      "text": "Since v1.13, an optional authentication token setting makes the extension send an Authorization: Bearer header on all LLM API requests; when empty, the header is omitted for backward compatibility."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5aeedf5a8c7c529d4885e79023445d6b7ea0ccb320c4434272c3f4fb81309542",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0",
          "git_sha": "2641425b9a93795eafaeb06bc8298da859cb5df0",
          "line_end": 59,
          "line_start": 59,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "emilianomusso/entwinellm",
          "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoMusso/EntwineLLM/blob/05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0/README.md#L59-L59"
        },
        {
          "commit": "05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0",
          "git_sha": "2641425b9a93795eafaeb06bc8298da859cb5df0",
          "line_end": 57,
          "line_start": 55,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "emilianomusso/entwinellm",
          "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoMusso/EntwineLLM/blob/05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0/README.md#L55-L57"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_29284ea0705b7e96c59ee698c18c86f9a3961bb880df554ac957215e5b08a1cd",
        "slc_e611ce744bee1d3251c59132619658cf02b2f0196db2f79c0f01441b4c8a9385"
      ],
      "text": "The project ships a docker-compose file and a sample nginx configuration to test an LLM behind an authenticating reverse proxy locally."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_90d08d1fb750a1e91da15903c5aefc90e3ad49f24092630935967588041a2201",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "skills-patterns",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0",
          "git_sha": "2641425b9a93795eafaeb06bc8298da859cb5df0",
          "line_end": 41,
          "line_start": 37,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "emilianomusso/entwinellm",
          "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoMusso/EntwineLLM/blob/05d11506b780514c68bef1c6a7bd3360f8a974e0/README.md#L37-L41"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1caed8b9147d133fc6776bb563ba040d9a9481e4d33038077cf45927c5cee455"
      ],
      "text": "The Follow-up feature lets users submit additional prompts that build on a prior code generation, sending the follow-up to the LLM for updated results."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d496e2732aac8432cfddf70194315f9729284807c5799199f227bdfe490ba9ab",
